    {
      "id": "odJFCrnl2edlBDdz1C5Ja",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 781.0000000000001,
      "height": 650.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1629526406,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1730483679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793600000000,
      "created": 1793600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Job Scheduler\n\nFunctional requirements\n- schedule jobs: immediately / at a time / recurring (cron)\n- query job status (my jobs, each execution)\nOut of scope: cancel / reschedule, job dependencies (DAG)\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (status query eventually consistent)\n- timeliness: start within 2s of scheduled time\n- scale: 10k executions/s at peak\n- reliability: at-least-once, no job lost\n- isolation: a slow / failed job doesn't affect others\n\nEstimation\n- 10k/s ~ 864M executions/day x 200B ~ 170GB/day -> partition + TTL\n- avg 2s x 10k/s ~ 20k concurrent slots -> autoscale workers\n\nCore entities\n- Task / Job / Execution / User\n\nAPI\nPOST /jobs {task_id, schedule{type, expr}, parameters} -> job_id\nGET /jobs -> my jobs\nGET /executions?status=&start=&end= -> my executions\nGET /jobs/{jobId}/executions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job Scheduler\n\nFunctional requirements\n- schedule jobs: immediately / at a time / recurring (cron)\n- query job status (my jobs, each execution)\nOut of scope: cancel / reschedule, job dependencies (DAG)\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (status query eventually consistent)\n- timeliness: start within 2s of scheduled time\n- scale: 10k executions/s at peak\n- reliability: at-least-once, no job lost\n- isolation: a slow / failed job doesn't affect others\n\nEstimation\n- 10k/s ~ 864M executions/day x 200B ~ 170GB/day -> partition + TTL\n- avg 2s x 10k/s ~ 20k concurrent slots -> autoscale workers\n\nCore entities\n- Task / Job / Execution / User\n\nAPI\nPOST /jobs {task_id, schedule{type, expr}, parameters} -> job_id\nGET /jobs -> my jobs\nGET /executions?status=&start=&end= -> my executions\nGET /jobs/{jobId}/executions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
